<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Corp says buys JNR land for Y183.9 bln.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Corp says buys JNR land for Y183.9 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Corp said on Friday it had bought land auctioned by the JNR Settlement Corp for 183.9 billion yen.  </p>
<p>A spokesman for JNR Settlement Corp said a group represented by Mitsubishi Corp had bought the land at a price of 3.49 million yen per square metre compared with an official estimated price of 2.40 million yen per square metre for that area.</p>
<p>The group of 10 firms included Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd, Mitsubishi Motors Corp, Tokyo Tatemono Co Ltd and Canon Sales Co Inc.</p>
<p>He said the land would be developed for commercial use, hotels and office buildings.</p>
</text>
